        <item>
            <title>2.2.4</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 23 Jun 2026 10:41:38 +0530</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Deveshb15/aura</link>
            <sparkle:version>22</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.2.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>A calmer library, and the notch on every display</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>New notes stay put.</b> Writing a note now opens it at the top-left and keeps it exactly there — saving it (or starting another) no longer reshuffles the grid or makes the card jump out and snap back. Only its column gently slides to make room.</li>
  <li><b>The notch follows your screen.</b> On a dual-monitor setup the notch now appears on whichever display your cursor is on — reach for the top of that screen and it opens there, even on external monitors without a real notch.</li>
  <li><b>Polish.</b> Filter tabs show per-category counts, the notch gained an “Open App” shortcut under the recents strip, and Carpet checks for updates more often.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/Deveshb15/aura/releases/download/v2.2.4/Carpet-2.2.4.dmg" length="17949936" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="OAswYn2o3vFEJRRLlic+xEiYGfHECjidTEa3jTy9iRAa5BzgzyDi4ltXVJ21IL/IByiWl0rP0D6nUVxzeb6pBw=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>2.2.3</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 18 Jun 2026 15:30:50 +0530</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Deveshb15/aura</link>
            <sparkle:version>21</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.2.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Import your X bookmarks, properly</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>X bookmark setup is back.</b> Settings → Data now walks you through it: a <b>How does this work?</b> guide (get the extension → bookmark on X → import your history) and an <b>Import my bookmarks…</b> button that pulls in up to 400 of your existing X bookmarks.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/Deveshb15/aura/releases/download/v2.2.3/Carpet-2.2.3.dmg" length="17924281" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="3Gh/3RxP6fa5h8kDUbB9vEEdy4gtwr1RZGuBUkVEwQuIJJC9JHP09cNdkqVk9luFn4kY3UFdpcNwHuhlJbH1CA=="/>
