            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>X bookmark sync is here</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>The browser extension is live.</b> Carpet — X Bookmark Sync is now on the Chrome Web Store. Settings → Data has a new <b>Get the extension</b> button to install it and start syncing your X bookmarks straight into Carpet.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
