            <link>https://github.com/Deveshb15/aura</link>
            <sparkle:version>19</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.2.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Dropped images from the web now stick</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>Web image drops are fixed.</b> Dragging a picture straight out of Safari, Chrome, or another browser onto the notch now reliably saves the image itself — instead of quietly doing nothing, or filing away the page link in its place.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
